{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10113130","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10113130","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1011313001:0":{"text":"……おばあさま、今お話ししたように、ブライトの傭兵たちはわざと私たちとブライトの関係を悪化させようとしているようなんです。","source_cn":"……婆婆，就像我们说的那样，不知道为什么，耀光的佣兵们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FF9CD5A4A0CE36E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1011313002:0":{"text":"それに茨の護衛隊の動きも怪しい。彼らは対立を煽るために、ダミアンを迷宮の中へ追い込んだんですよ！","source_cn":"而荆棘卫队也行踪诡秘。为了进一步激化矛盾，他们甚至一路...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x290F1B90B3943CE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1011313003:0":{"text":"それだけでなく、彼らはダミアンの失踪をブライトの難民たちのせいにしようとしていました……私たちが駆けつけなかったらどうなっていたか……","source_cn":"不仅如此，他们还试图将达米安的失踪嫁祸给耀光难民……要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9581DA7ED20E05C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1011313004:0":{"text":"なぜ茨は変わってしまったのです？保守的だったとはいえ、ここまで極端な人たちではなかったはずだ。","source_cn":"荆棘为什么会变成这样？他们固然保守，可怎么会突然变得如...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA20963D5BBE6DFF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1011313005:0":{"text":"イミルの老いぼれが言い出したに決まってるさ！この前の賢者会議で、茨の護衛隊から報告を聞いた後、あいつはキッパリと言い切ったんだ。","source_cn":"伊米尔那老家伙，肯定是他授意！之前在贤者会议上，他听完...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA86DFD2D51C82B0","var